lead@ghost:  1 4 6 3 1' 6 4 2 | markov | bell | semi 12 | wow 0.3 | reverb 0.7 | delay 0.5 | degrade 40 | gain 0.07 | hue 60

# ---------- BOÎTE À MUSIQUE / cloches désaccordées (le côté fragile) ----------
box@emerge:    walk(8) | bell | detune 6 | wow 0.3 | reverb 0.7 | delay 0.4 | degrade 30 | gain 0.07 | pan 0.3 | hue 50
box@dissolve:  perlin(16) | bell | detune 5 | semi 12 | reverb 0.8 | echo 8 0.5 | degrade 35 | gain 0.06 | pan -0.3 | hue 60
box@ghost:     pi(16) | bell | detune 4 | reverb 0.85 | delay 0.5 | degrade 45 | gain 0.06 | hue 190

# ---------- POLYMÉTRIE en dérive (phasing microtonal) ----------
