ph2@bloom:  1 4 6 3 5 1' | poly 17 | pluck 0.6 | reverb 0.6 | gate 0.5 | pan 0.35 | gain 0.07 | hue 320
ph3@swarm:  1 3 5 6 4 2 | poly 11 | pluck 0.6 | autopan 0.3 | reverb 0.5 | gate 0.5 | gain 0.06 | hue 240

# ---------- STABS / GLITCHES numériques ----------
